web/frontend/node_modules
web/frontend/dist
web/viewer-deps/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
**/node_modules
**/*.pyc
web/frontend/.vite
